..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name      : DISPLAYS.SUM.CHILDS
.. Autor         : fwester
.. Verantwortlich: fwester
.. Kontrolle     : xg
.. Funktion      : Summiert abwaerts die Kinder des Elementes nach ihrer Art.
.. Ablauf        : Unterprogramm
..
.. Functionality : Sums downward the children of the element depending on their
.. type.
.. Program flow  : Subroutine
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.type integer  xsum2 ? _F|defined(U|xsum2)
.type integer  xsum3 ? _F|defined(U|xsum3)

.formula U|xsum2 = 0
.formula U|xsum3 = 0
..
!KNOTRUN: Run knot from current element downward
.select screen line
.continue END ? _G|mehr
.continue END ? M|stufe = M|tbaumstufe
.. Sum children
.formula U|xsum2 = U|xsum2 + 1 ? M|typeofelem = M|screennode ; M|typeofelem = M|usernode
.formula U|xsum3 = U|xsum3 + 1 ? M|typeofelem = M|pidleaf
.continue KNOTRUN
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
